ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1168530/extras/821e2111f5818fba99dc1383ab88287d.avif?t=1727701085\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Promote the cycle of history</h2>A tower climber has fallen, and the next generation has already packed. All kinds of life, but never give up.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game won only 2-3 hours. But the world will advance under high difficulty, and the content and ending will change.<br></li><li>The equipment can be permanently saved as a relic, and can be collected with a specific recipe in the future game. Don't say much, go and collect!</li></ul>",
